     *
     * Captcha: action ``
     *
     * Errors (bound by contract):
     * - `CaptchaInvalid` (400) — Captcha verification failed. Please try again.
     * - `CaptchaRequired` (400) — Captcha token is required.
     * - `InvalidRedirectUrl` (400) — redirect_url must be a relative path starting with /  — absolute URLs are not allowed.
     * - `MagicLinkRate` (429) — Too many magic link requests. Please try again later.
     *
     * @return `MagicLinkRequestResponse` (200)
     *
     * @param body DRF serializer mixin that validates a `captcha_token` field.
     *
     * Add this mixin **before** `serializers.Serializer` in the MRO so that
     * `validate_captcha_token` runs during DRF field-level validation.
     *
     * Call `self._require_captcha_if_configured(attrs)` from `validate()`
     * to return `ERR_400_CAPTCHA_REQUIRED` when captcha is active but the
     * client omitted the token entirely.
     */
    public suspend fun magicRequest(body: MagicLinkRequestBody): StapelResult<MagicLinkRequestResponse, MagicRequestError>

