     *
     * Wire: `POST /auth/api/v1/oauth/login/`   `auth_api_v1_oauth_login_create`
     *
     * Permissions: DenyEnrollOnly
     *
     * Auth: optional
     *
     * Available only when `AUTH_OAUTH_LOGIN` and `AUTH_OAUTH_REGISTRATION` is enabled.
     *
     * Errors (bound by contract):
     * - `AttributionInvalid` (400) — The attribution object is malformed. Expected {captured_at} plus either a click_id with its click_id_type (gclid|gbraid|wbraid|yclid|fbclid|ttclid) or a utm object naming a source.
